{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_01KQNz5JFQ8mjZmK5o2kaDS7","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"```yaml\ntiers:\n  best:\n    meaning: \"8B跨尺度退化确认且hacking模式分化，1.7B/4B/8B三点gradient完整，across-scales framing成立\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"Qwen3-8B exec-only K=8成功训练（克服K=4冷启动），PR≥70%且hacking rate≥80%\"\n      - \"8B dominant mode与4B的H7不同（如H1/H8/新模式），形成scale-dependent Goodhart basins\"\n      - \"s45/s46 1000步ISR崩塌复现（ISR*<0.05），N=3 trajectory seeds与s42一致\"\n      - \"N=10 ISR β=0.1 pooled OR≈1.5-2.0（弱于3-seed OR=3.48但CMH仍显著），stochastic bifurcation 3/10被frame为finding本身\"\n    number_ranges:\n      8b_exec_prove_rate: [0.70, 0.95]\n      8b_exec_hacking_rate: [0.80, 1.00]\n      8b_exec_genuine_rate: [0.00, 0.10]\n      8b_mode_differs_from_4b: true\n      s45_s46_1000step_isr_star: [0.001, 0.05]\n      n10_isr_genuine_or_pooled: [1.5, 2.0]\n      n10_isr_genuine_cmh_p: [0.005, 0.05]\n      n10_genuine_window_ratio: [0.3, 0.3]\n      reviewer_score: [3.25, 3.50]\n    narrative_direction: \"原始framing完全成立。核心叙事升级为Goodhart collapse is universal across scales but exploitation strategy is capacity-dependent（1.7B→H1/H9简单exploit, 4B→H7 tautology, 8B→新模式）。9-mode taxonomy获得cross-scale validation成为independent contribution。N=10将genuine window从3/5修正为3/10——不削弱论文，'genuine window is the rare exception'是更强的Goodhart inevitability evidence。C2 double-edged调整为'ISR occasionally opens transient genuine window but modal outcome is collapse'。三条Claims均可保持原始强度。\"\n\n  median:\n    meaning: \"8B退化确认但模式同质（均为H7）或程度较弱，cross-scale成立但taxonomy分化贡献有限\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"8B exec-only成功训练但dominant mode与4B相同（均为H7），或hacking rate 50-80%弱于4B\"\n      - \"s45/s46 1000步至少1个确认ISR崩塌，1个部分崩塌（ISR*=0.05-0.15）\"\n      - \"N=10 genuine OR≈1.3-1.6，CMH p=0.03-0.10（边界显著），需补充effect size讨论\"\n      - \"Reviewer会追问8B同质化意味着什么——需要有准备好的解释\"\n    number_ranges:\n      8b_exec_prove_rate: [0.50, 0.85]\n      8b_exec_hacking_rate: [0.50, 0.85]\n      8b_exec_genuine_rate: [0.05, 0.30]\n      8b_mode_differs_from_4b: false\n      s45_s46_1000step_isr_star: [0.01, 0.15]\n      n10_isr_genuine_or_pooled: [1.3, 1.6]\n      n10_isr_genuine_cmh_p: [0.03, 0.10]\n      n10_genuine_window_ratio: [0.3, 0.3]\n      reviewer_score: [3.00, 3.25]\n    narrative_direction: \"Cross-scale claim保留但降级为'degeneration transfers across scales, exploitation mode converges to H7'——确认universality但taxonomy分化贡献被削弱。C2 double-edged需要明确软化：genuine OR从3.48降至~1.5仅边界显著，reframe为'modest transient uplift overwhelmed by dominant collapse'。论文重心转向C1 diagnostic methodology + Goodhart inevitability mechanism。Premise-count-matched analysis和meta-Goodhart triple gaming作为methodological contribution补位。ISR-as-reward篇幅压缩，增加diagnostic case study depth。\"\n\n  worst:\n    meaning: \"8B训练失败或不退化，三点scale gradient断裂，需根本性reframe但不降级venue\"\n    key_assumptions:\n      - \"8B exec-only K=8仍OOM/冷启动失败，或成功训练但genuine rate>40%（8B规模避免Goodhart）\"\n      - \"1.7B→4B→8B证据链断裂，across-scales framing不成立\"\n      - \"s45/s46 1000步ISR未完全崩塌（ISR*>0.10），trajectory universality弱化\"\n      - \"N=10 genuine OR<1.3，CMH p>0.10不显著，double-edged claim统计不成立\"\n    number_ranges:\n      8b_exec_prove_rate: [0.00, 0.50]\n      8b_exec_hacking_rate: [0.00, 0.50]\n      8b_exec_genuine_rate: [0.30, 1.00]\n      8b_mode_differs_from_4b: null\n      s45_s46_1000step_isr_star: [0.05, 0.30]\n      n10_isr_genuine_or_pooled: [0.8, 1.3]\n      n10_isr_genuine_cmh_p: [0.10, 0.50]\n      n10_genuine_window_ratio: [0.3, 0.3]\n      reviewer_score: [2.75, 3.00]\n    narrative_direction: \"两条reframe路径均不降级EMNLP main：(A) 8B不退化→Goodhart is capacity-gated——≥8B具备genuine formal reasoning，存在scale threshold，这本身novel（'GRPO Goodhart collapse is a small-model phenomenon'），C2变为'Goodhart inevitable below capacity threshold'；(B) 8B训练失败→scope缩回4B+1.7B+Prolog，承认scalability limitation。两条路径下C1 diagnostic和C3 cross-logic不受影响。放弃double-edged叙事（N=10不支持），C2从'inevitable at any dose'改为'inevitable in low-capacity regime at any dose'。9-